## 5. ViewType Union and App Store (`src/store/app-store.ts`)

**File:** `D:\CLAUDE\Project\zakuppro\zakuppro\src\store\app-store.ts`

The `ViewType` union on line 3:
```typescript
export type ViewType = 'dashboard' | 'projects' | 'project-detail' | 'suppliers' | 'supplier-detail'
  | 'warehouse' | 'requests' | 'invoices' | 'analytics' | 'automation' | 'settings'
```

The store (Zustand) on lines 5-29:
```typescript
interface AppState {
  currentView: ViewType
  selectedProjectId: string | null
  selectedSupplierId: string | null
  setSelectedProjectId: (id: string | null) => void
  setSelectedSupplierId: (id: string | null) => void
  navigate: (view: ViewType) => void
  navigateToProject: (id: string) => void
  navigateToSupplier: (id: string) => void
}
```

Views with detail sub-views (`project-detail`, `supplier-detail`) store their selected entity ID separately. The `navigate` action clears the opposite entity ID when switching views (lines 22-26).

