## Summary of Patterns Relevant to a DLQ Admin UI Slice

| Concern | Pattern to Follow |
|---|---|
| **Types** | Define `DlqMessageBase`, `DlqMessageResponse` (extends Base + id/timestamps), `DlqMessageUpdate`, and optionally a `PaginatedResponse<DlqMessageResponse>` in `src/types/fastapi.ts`. |
| **API client** | Create `src/lib/api/dlq.ts` with `const BASE_PATH = '/api/dlq'`, named functions using `apiClient.get<T>()`/`apiClient.post<T>()` etc., and a grouped `dlqApi` export. |
| **Barrel export** | Add `export { dlqApi } from '@/lib/api/dlq'` and the associated types in `src/lib/api/index.ts`. |
| **View type** | Add `'dlq-admin'` to the `ViewType` union in `src/store/app-store.ts`. |
| **Nav item** | Add `{ label: 'DLQ', icon: AlertTriangle, view: 'dlq-admin' }` to `mainNavItems` in `app-sidebar.tsx`. |
| **Role gating** | Add `'dlq-admin'` to the appropriate role access lists in both `app-sidebar.tsx` (sidebar filter) and `page.tsx` (roleViewAccess). |
| **View component** | Add `import { DlqAdmin } from '@/components/app/dlq-admin'` and a render block in `page.tsx`. |
| **Page title** | Add `'dlq-admin': 'DLQ Администрирование'` to `pageTitles` in `page.tsx`. |
| **Auth** | Use `const { role } = useAuth()` from `@/components/providers/auth-provider` for any per-component feature gating. |

